Pets have the habit of not attacking anything they can't handle.
I think a Demon lord is someting they can't. 
 
But speaking of Demon lords, I thought that it was about time to
ask the thing that's bothered me for a long time. In Hell, there
are sometimes moats with Demon lords in the middle. I've never
gone to say hello to one, but people have told me that they ask
for money "in order not to kill you instead". Ok. Fine.
Suppose that one doesn't give the Demon the money he needs but
kills him. Does the Lord leave something *valuable* behind or
only some random items? I'd find it very pleasing if they
carried cursed potions of gain level.. 
